{
    "title": "Hushed: US Second Phone Number",
    "description": "CALL AND TEXT ON A TEMPORARY PHONE NUMBER WITH A FREE TRIAL SUBSCRIPTION\r\n\r\nHushed gives you a temporary phone number that\u2019s perfect for online dating, travel, shopping, moving, selling stuff, or just protecting your privacy by not giving our your real phone number.\r\n\r\nChoose from phone numbers in 300+ area codes, and start calling and texting immediately. No one will know you\u2019re calling from a Hushed number.\r\n\r\nMore than 25 million people have downloaded Hushed, making more than 450 million phone calls and sending more than 1 billion texts.\r\n\r\nWhy everyone loves Hushed:\r\n\r\nANONYMOUS CALLS: Make phone calls that aren\u2019t connected to your real phone number.\r\n\r\nPRIVATE TEXTS: Send and receive private text messages that are fully separate from your real phone number.\r\n\r\nSECOND PHONE NUMBER: Get as many phone numbers as you want! Hushed is perfect for separating different areas of your life.\r\n\r\n300+ AREA CODES: Pick a phone number with a Canada area code, United States area code, or United Kingdom area code \u2013 even if you\u2019re halfway across the world!\r\n\r\nCALLER ID PRIVACY: Caller ID will show the Hushed phone number, but never show your name. \r\n\r\nFREE VOICEMAIL: Every Hushed virtual number includes premium phone features, like free voicemail, free call forwarding, free call routing, and free auto-reply texts.\r\n\r\nVoIP TECHNOLOGY: Hushed calls and texts run over the internet with VoIP (Voice over Internet Protocol) technology, so you can make calls all over the world without long distance charges.\r\n\r\nNO SIM CARD NEEDED: Your Hushed phone numbers are stored securely in the app, so you never need to swap SIM cards or mess with new SIMs.\r\n\r\nNO CONTRACTS: Hushed keeps things flexible, and you can cancel anytime!\r\n\r\nBURNER PHONE NUMBER: Delete your untraceable phone number easily. Hushed is great for short-term or long-term use.\r\n\r\nPopular reasons for getting a temp phone number:\r\n\r\nONLINE DATING: It can be dangerous to give your real phone number to a stranger. Give them a temporary phone number instead to protect your privacy. It's not technically a fake number because you can call/text with it.\r\n\r\nSELLING STUFF ONLINE: When you use an anonymous phone number for online ads, you can delete the number if you keep getting annoying calls once the item's been sold.\r\n\r\nMOVING: Get a temporary phone number in your new area code even before you make the move! Perfect for setting up utilities.\r\n\r\nTRAVEL: Snag a temporary phone number in the area code you\u2019ll be visiting to avoid long-distance fees.\r\n\r\nFAMILY & FRIENDS: If you have family or friends who live far away, get a temporary phone number in their local area code so it's a local call.\r\n\r\nSHOPPING: Stores are always asking for your phone number so they can text you special discounts, add you to loyalty programs, or refund purchases. Give them your fake phone number instead.\r\n\r\nACCOUNT VERIFICATION: While we can\u2019t promise Hushed numbers will be compatible with every third-party service, many will allow Hushed numbers to receive a verification code/shortcode text or call.\r\n\r\nAVOIDING SPAM: Use a temporary number for forms, surveys, and sign-ups to protect your real number from spammed. Use a temporary phone number instead, and keep the junk off your regular number.\r\n\r\nReady for a temporary phone number?\r\n\r\nFLEXIBLE TEMPORARY PHONE NUMBER PLANS: Choose from 1 & 3 line subscriptions with U.S., Canada, or U.K. numbers. Enjoy unlimited calls and texts with a 20% discount on annual plans.\r\n\r\nCONVENIENT BILLING: Subscriptions renew automatically unless they are deactivated 24 hours before the cycle ends. Modify or cancel your temporary phone line subscription in your Google Play settings.\r\n\r\nKEEP IN MIND: Hushed is not suited for 911 services, so you\u2019ll need to use your regular phone number for that.\r\n\r\nDownload Hushed to get your own temporary phone number. Need help? Our team is available 24/7 via live chat (https://hushed.com ) or email (support@hushed.com).",
